{"route":"/utilities/","file":"utilities.html","title":"Utilities - TechnoAi","description":"Drones improve safety and efficiency in the utilities industry by streamlining powerline and solar panel inspections, reducing hazards, and enabling advanced fault detection and maintenance.","canonical":"https://technoai.ae/utilities/","ogImage":"https://technoai.ae/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Utilities.jpg","kind":"page","date":"2025-01-21T09:21:15+04:00","hero":{"title":"UTILITY DRONE SOLUTIONS","lead":[],"buttons":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Utility_cover.jpg"},"sections":[{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Intelligent Inspection for Critical Infrastructure"},{"t":"p","html":"Improve the safety, efficiency, and reliability of infrastructure inspections with enterprise drone solutions designed for utility and industrial operations. From power transmission and renewable energy assets to pipelines, telecommunications, and industrial facilities, our aerial platforms deliver high-resolution intelligence that enables faster inspections, reduces operational risk, and supports proactive asset management."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"grid","items":[{"title":"Infrastructure Inspection","text":[],"list":[],"icon":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" id=\"Layer_1\" x=\"0px\" y=\"0px\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" style=\"enable-background:new 0 0 512 512;\" xml:space=\"preserve\"><g>\t<g>\t\t<g>\t\t\t<path d=\"M480.36,494.742h-14.382V43.146c0-4.767-3.864-8.629-8.629-8.629H296.27c-4.766,0-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629v37.393    h-17.258V43.146c0-4.767-3.864-8.629-8.629-8.629H224.36V8.629c0-4.767-3.864-8.629-8.629-8.629s-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629v25.888    h-37.393c-4.766,0-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629v37.393h-25.888c-4.766,0-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629v71.91h-71.91    c-4.766,0-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629v325.034H31.64c-4.766,0-8.629,3.862-8.629,8.629S26.875,512,31.64,512H480.36    c4.766,0,8.629-3.862,8.629-8.629S485.125,494.742,480.36,494.742z M178.33