factories, storage tanks, ports, and other critical infrastructure with high-resolution aerial data that supports predictive maintenance and operational planning."],"list":[],"image":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Industrial-Asset-Inspection.jpg"}]}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RTK-Section-3.jpg","alt":"","bg":true},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"BUILT FOR INFRASTRUCTURE INSPECTION"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"Advanced Capabilities for Asset Management"},{"t":"p","html":"Modern utility operations require accurate, timely information to maintain critical infrastructure safely and efficiently. Our enterprise drone solutions combine intelligent imaging, precision positioning, and automated flight capabilities to help organisations inspect assets faster, improve maintenance planning, and minimise operational disruption."},{"t":"p","html":"High-resolution imaging, thermal sensing, laser range finding, and RTK positioning enable detailed inspections of infrastructure assets while capturing accurate data for maintenance planning, engineering analysis, and regulatory compliance."}]},{"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"FEATURED PLATFORM"},{"t":"h","level":2,"html":"DJI Matrice 350 RTK"},{"t":"p","html":"The DJI Matrice 350 RTK is one of the flagship platforms within our utility drone portfolio, delivering exceptional reliability, RTK precision, and compatibility with advanced payloads for infrastructure inspection. Designed for power utilities, oil &amp; gas, renewable energy, telecommunications, and industrial asset management, it provides dependable aerial intelligence that supports accurate inspections, faster maintenance planning, and safer operations across critical infrastructure."},{"t":"img","src":"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/RTK-Front-Top-View-copy-scaled.webp","alt":"","bg":true}]}]}